  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, on prend Rexillius !\nY a pas plus fort que le Pokémon Tyran !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020006F006E0020007000720065006E006400200052006500780069006C006C00690075007300200021000A005900200061002000700061007300200070006C0075007300200066006F0072007400200071007500650020006C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200054007900720061006E0020002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça, c’est toi qui le dis ! Moi, je pense\nque Dragmara est tout aussi fort !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dis, toi ! T’es Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse, non ?\nEntre Rexillius et Dragmara, tu choisirais qui ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais on s’en fiche de l’avis d’un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿਈ inconnue inconnue !\nD’ailleurs, on s’en fiche du tien aussi !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On achète le Fossile Mâchoire, et puis c’est tout !\nC’est moi l’aîné, donc c’est moi qui décide !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais c’est pas juste !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200063201900650073007400200070006100730020006A0075007300740065002000210021002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dis, est-ce que tu peux montrer à mon frère qu’il\na tort sur toute la ligne à propos de Dragmara ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu le bats avec seulement un Dragmara dans\nton équipe, je suis sûre qu’il changera d’avis !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour avoir un Dragmara, il faut restaurer un\nFossile Nageoire, puis faire évoluer l’Amagara<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nobtenu en le faisant monter de niveau !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à affronter mon frère\navec un Dragmara, viens me voir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour avoir un Dragmara, il faut restaurer un\nFossile Nageoire, puis faire évoluer l’Amagara<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nobtenu en le faisant monter de niveau !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuand t’en auras un, ajoute-le à ton équipe\npour affronter mon grand frère !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 219
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu veux te battre, fais gaffe à n’avoir\nque Dragmara dans ton équipe !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSinon, ma sœur va continuer à se plaindre...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, t’as ramené un Dragmara ! Merci beaucoup !\nT’es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe pour le combat ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Absolument !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200065006E0063006F00720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prends ton temps. Faut que ton Dragmara soit\nau top de sa forme pour montrer sa puissance !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Donne-toi à fond pour montrer toute la puissance\nde Dragmara !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E006E0065002D0074006F0069002000E000200066006F006E006400200070006F007500720020006D006F006E007400720065007200200074006F0075007400650020006C00610020007000750069007300730061006E00630065000A0064006500200044007200610067006D0061007200610020002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pfff ! Je sais pas d’où tu sors avec ton Dragmara,\nmais c’est mon Rexillius qui va gagner !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aha ! Je savais que Dragmara était trop fort !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680061002000210020004A00650020007300610076006100690073002000710075006500200044007200610067006D006100720061002000E90074006100690074002000740072006F007000200066006F007200740020002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as vu ça, Mash ?\nIl nous faut absolument un Fossile Nageoire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054201900610073002000760075002000E70061002C0020004D0061007300680020003F000A0049006C0020006E006F00750073002000660061007500740020006100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E007400200075006E00200046006F007300730069006C00650020004E006100670065006F0069007200650020002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pas grâce à son Dragmara qu’<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂilelle a gagné,\nc’est juste un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse super doué<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "O-oui, mais...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F002D006F00750069002C0020006D006100690073002E002E002E00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu veux vraiment me prouver la force\nde Dragmara, y a pas mille moyens...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Faut que tu m’affrontes avec ton propre\nDragmara !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600610075007400200071007500650020007400750020006D20190061006600660072006F006E0074006500730020006100760065006300200074006F006E002000700072006F007000720065000A0044007200610067006D0061007200610020002100100002011401820000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein... ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E002E002E002E0020003F00100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais te l’acheter, ton Fossile Nageoire. Mais\nce sera à toi de le restaurer et de l’entraîner !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci beaucoup d’avoir affronté mon grand frère !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002000620065006100750063006F0075007000200064201900610076006F0069007200200061006600660072006F006E007400E90020006D006F006E0020006700720061006E006400200066007200E8007200650020002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais entraîner le Dragmara le plus fort\ndu monde !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007600610069007300200065006E00740072006100EE006E006500720020006C006500200044007200610067006D0061007200610020006C006500200070006C0075007300200066006F00720074000A006400750020006D006F006E006400650020002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trop contente de faire ta connaissance,\nAmagara !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072006F007000200063006F006E00740065006E0074006500200064006500200066006100690072006500200074006100200063006F006E006E00610069007300730061006E00630065002C000A0041006D006100670061007200610020002100100002011401810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand Nagette aura son Dragmara et moi\nmon Rexillius, on fera le combat du siècle !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
